flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B[Select Child Profile]
    B --> C[Load Recent Drawings]
    C --> D{Drawings Available?}
    D -->|No| E[Show No Data Message]
    E --> F[End]
    D -->|Yes| G[Gather Drawing Analyses]
    G --> H[Check Analysis Status]
    H --> I{All Analyzed?}
    I -->|No| J[Analyze Pending Drawings]
    J --> K[Compile Summaries]
    I -->|Yes| K
    K --> L[Send to OpenAI]
    L --> M[Generate Recommendations]
    M --> N[Categorize by Priority]
    N --> O[Save to Database]
    O --> P[Deactivate Old Recommendations]
    P --> Q[Display Results]
    Q --> F
    
    style A fill:#90caf9
    style F fill:#90caf9
    style D fill:#ffcc80
    style I fill:#ffcc80